From: StripeyHorse <stripeyhorse@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:12:15 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 11/12] RSX: configure fullscreen output and live Metal
 post-processing

Select a fullscreen drawable or swapchain size and preserve the physical view aspect under compositor scaling. Queue live Metal present options and resample only the post-processing work surface, leaving RSX targets and readbacks at guest dimensions.
